@startuml
autonumber

actor User
participant "UI" as UI
participant "DatabaseDumpAction" as API
participant "AbstractTestService" as Validation
participant "BackupConfigurationService" as Config
participant "PlatformService" as platform
participant "BackupMongodbService" as Backup
participant "StateHolder" as status
participant "RecordsService" as Record
participant "Server/Windows" as Storage

User -> UI: Click the backup button
UI -> API: Call the backup interface
API -> Validation: Verify input
Validation -> Validation: Check special characters (">", "<", "|", "&")
Validation -> Validation: Check remoteAccess reachability
Validation -> Validation: Check the mount directory
Validation -> Validation: Check write permissions
Validation -> Validation: Check disk space
Validation -> API: Verification success / failure

API -> platform: Get environment configuration
Config -> API: Return database username, password, port, host, etc.

API -> status: Update status to Running
API -> Record: Create backup record
API -> Backup: Execute backup
API --> UI: Return "Backup started" (no need to wait for completion)

... The backup task is executed in the background ...
Backup -> Storage: Generate .tmp temporary files
Backup -> Backup: Encrypt backup files
Backup -> Storage: Generate .db backup file
Backup -> Storage: Delete .tmp file
Backup -> status: Update status to Completed

loop poll status
UI -> status: Get task state
status -> UI: Return status

alt status == "running"
UI -> status: Continue polling
else status == "fail" or "completed"
UI -> User: Polling ends
end

@enduml
